This distribution includes the public Nisi 0.2.0 workflow library, journal,
and CLI, licensed under Apache-2.0. Its original LICENSE and pinned provenance
manifest are included alongside the Nisi package.

The optional Jev connector is included. The TypeSafe-hosted Jev service,
private Nisi/Jev router infrastructure, external model weights, separately
managed model services and Windows workers are not bundled. Their own terms
apply separately. Node.js and Python are separate runtime prerequisites.

Windows configured-Mac attribution, peer inventory completeness and LAN failure
metadata adapt the Windows parity logic published in this same AGIW Suite
repository at commit 7e7a9ffe3e204faeaad914b30342ee7bfcf10b5c (branch
claude/agiw-cli-v0.1), windows/agiw_win/collect.py and windows/agiw_win/probes.py,
under Apache-2.0. The same windows/agiw_win tree was previously cited at commit
6e76d6b06c0d70beccb5991c9e09984510ea8608, which is no longer published.
